flowchart TD
    A[Human request or evidence-backed enhancement] --> B{Preserves UI contract?}
    B -->|No| X[Stop and request explicit human direction]
    B -->|Yes| C[Record component, breakpoint, locale, state, accessibility, performance, backend boundary]
    C --> D[Implement small contextual change with existing Django and CSS tokens]
    D --> E[Run focused tests and browser states]
    E --> F{Checks green?}
    F -->|No| G[Root-cause analysis and repair]
    G --> E
    F -->|Yes| H[Update contract/guides when needed]
    H --> I[Commit logical chunk, push PR to dev, wait for review; never self-merge]
